error[E0442]: 'found' is assigned inside a loop
 --> $DIR/last-assigned-in-loop.nra:5:9
  |
3 |     last found: int;
  |          ----- declared outside the loop here
4 |     for (let value: int in values) {
  |     --- the loop that can repeat it
5 |         found = value;
  |         ^^^^^ this assignment could run more than once
